<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ascend raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ascend raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch raised its intermediate-term rating on Ascend Communications Inc to accumulate from neutral, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- Office of analyst Joe Bellace confirmed upgrade occurred but analyst was not immediately available to provide further details.  </p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3-3/4 to 47-1/2.</p>
</text>
